  "summary": "Four proofs extend the curve polar metric to the full model space of a rank-one background pulled back under a compact holomorphic submersion with connected fibers. Constant Gauduchon fiber volume normalizes the polar trace, giving an exact isometry, analytic closure, ideal retraction and an all-obstacle criterion; every top-degree mass is zero.",
